# Morrowind Temple: promotion to Disciple (6), which Tuls Valen's "Hassour" needs. Disciple asks one favored skill at
# 60, two at 20, Personality and Intelligence of 32 and reputation 60 (MorrowindRuntime's FACT table). SetRestoration,
# SetMysticism and SetAlchemy stand in for the player's training, SetPersonality and SetIntelligence for level-up
# choices; the reputation is the player's own from the duties before.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_galomdaeus_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_disciple
run
player->SetRestoration 60
player->SetMysticism 20
player->SetAlchemy 20
player->SetPersonality 32
player->SetIntelligence 32
talk tharer rotheloth
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank Temple >= 6
bye
end
